WEBVTT

00:06:27.625 --> 00:06:30.351
with representation in Hollywood.

00:06:30.375 --> 00:06:31.726
And it really hit me.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:34.309
I thought these things
but never really registered --

00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:35.643
I was really focused on --

00:06:35.667 --> 00:06:37.226
and I felt lucky to be working,

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.643
and so then I realized --

00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:40.393
yeah, what is wrong with Hollywood?

00:06:40.417 --> 00:06:41.768
Why aren't they doing this?

00:06:41.792 --> 00:06:45.726
And then I looked at myself in the mirror
and realized I am Hollywood.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.018
I literally --

00:06:47.042 --> 00:06:49.101
I popped my collar before I came out here,

00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:50.434
that's how Hollywood I am.

00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:51.476
(Laughter)

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.476
Is it still up? OK, good.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.000
(Applause)

00:06:56.292 --> 00:06:59.101
For all these years I felt
I had been given so much,

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:03.393
and what was I giving back
to the film business that I loved?